      "A BATCH REPORTS WHAT IT DID, AND A TRANCHE COUNTS WORK — the applier's verdict and its unit are both declared (BUG-923/BUG-924)": 1,
      "A QUARANTINE THAT DROPS THE FOLDER DESTROYS THE EVIDENCE IT EXISTS TO KEEP — the safety net may never replace a byte-source (BUG-936)": 1,
      "A RECORD AND ITS BYTES ARE ONE OBJECT — a checkpoint line is a promise about an artefact, so the artefact is asked before the promise is honoured (BUG-920)": 1,
      "A REMOVAL IS AN ACT WITH A RECEIPT — `disposed` IS A FIRST-CLASS ADMISSION STATE, AND THE DISPOSITION'S OWN RECEIPT IS THE REMOVAL RECORD (BUG-935)": 1,
